 # Prints "verified: ..." when the run resolves to a COMPLETED reviewer run whose model matches the
-# named one, "unverified: <reason>" otherwise, and nothing at all when there is no run id.
+# named one and references the expected bead or branch, "unverified: <reason>" otherwise, and nothing
